# MAGIC
# MAGIC ## Overview
# MAGIC
# MAGIC This lecture brings together two closing topics. First, a set of general **best practices** to keep in mind when implementing CI/CD for data engineering. Then a look at **next steps**: how DABs combine with **GitHub Actions** to automate deployment across environments using a GitFlow-style branching pattern, closing with a note on Git tools you can integrate with Databricks.
# MAGIC
# MAGIC ## Learning Objectives
# MAGIC
# MAGIC By the end of this lecture, you will be able to:
# MAGIC 1. **Summarize** the key best practices for implementing CI/CD in data engineering.
# MAGIC 2. **Describe** a deployment pattern that combines DABs with GitHub Actions and a GitFlow branching strategy.
# MAGIC 3. **Identify** common Git tools and services that integrate with Databricks.

