# MAGIC - Git is a free and open-source software framework designed to track changes in source code during software development.
# MAGIC - Version control enables tracking code changes for rollback and collaboration; branching and merging let multiple developers work in parallel; and a distributed workflow gives each developer a full local repository.
# MAGIC - You can integrate third-party Git tools and services &mdash; such as GitHub, GitHub Actions, GitLab, Azure DevOps, and Bitbucket &mdash; that make sense for your organizational needs.
# MAGIC - Databricks provides a user-friendly interface for common Git operations, lets you use remote Git repos while developing in notebooks, and offers a Repos REST API to automate Git workflows in CI/CD pipelines.
