# MAGIC ## D. Conclusion
# MAGIC
# MAGIC - Effective CI/CD for data engineering rests on five practices: a clear **testing** strategy, a **version control** strategy, a **code review** process, **automated deployment with DABs**, and ongoing **monitoring and optimization**.
# MAGIC - **DABs + GitHub Actions** automate deployment: branches map to environments, and Actions workflows deploy bundles while running tests, coverage, and security scans.
# MAGIC - A **GitFlow-style** pattern (feature, dev, release, main, hotfix) fits naturally with DABs.
# MAGIC - Databricks integrates with common **Git tools and services** &mdash; choose what fits your organization.
